{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Forty one dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is what one late payment on a credit\ncard can cost you right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6660,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not forty one dollars a year. Forty one\ndollars for being a single day late,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11960,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one time, on one card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14780,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you thought that number was\nsupposed to come down this year, you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18540,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not imagining things. It was. There was a\nrule written to cut it down to eight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23442,
    "dDurationMs": 3718,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollars, and most people still believe\nthat rule is in place today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27540,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not. A court threw it out, and\nalmost nobody was told."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32760,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is one of three changes moving\nthrough the credit card world right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and two of them are already touching your\naccount, whether you have noticed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41000,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42320,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is costing older people money every\nsingle month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46480,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is showing up on your credit report in\na way it never used to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51040,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the third one is a protection you\nalready have, that hardly any older person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55800,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knows to use, and it can stop a bank from\nturning you down for a card because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60540,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your age. So let me walk you through\nall three, in order, in plain words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66520,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and tell you exactly what to do about each\none."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70000,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third one is the one I most want you\nto remember, because it is the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74280,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that works in your favor. Let me start\nwith that late fee, because it is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79300,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one taking money out of pockets today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81180,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years, credit card companies charged\nwhatever they liked when a payment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85520,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came in late. Thirty dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88080,
    "dDurationMs": 376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thirty five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89320,
    "dDurationMs": 277,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Forty one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90580,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It became one of the most profitable\nthings a bank could do, because a late"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94600,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "payment costs them almost nothing to\nprocess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97700,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the consumer protection agency in\nWashington wrote a rule to stop it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102460,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That rule would have capped the late fee\nat eight dollars, and it was set to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106260,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "save households billions of dollars every\nyear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109040,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The banks took it to court. And in the\nspring of last year, a federal judge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114420,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Texas threw the rule out completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117340,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It never took effect. Not for one single\nday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121180,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is where that leaves you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123400,
    "dDurationMs": 3949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Late fees are right back where they were,\nrunning about thirty to forty one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127349,
    "dDurationMs": 1831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollars at most major banks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130140,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you are one of the many people who\nheard the news back when the eight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133600,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollar cap was announced, and assumed the\nproblem had been solved, this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138120,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your correction. Nothing changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140860,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fee that hits your account is the full\namount, same as always."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145360,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what do you actually do about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147960,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two things, and both of them work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150300,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is the one that surprises people\nthe most, because it is so simple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154160,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it feels like it should not work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156480,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you get hit with a late fee, call the\nnumber on the back of your card and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160140,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ask them to remove it. That is the whole\nscript."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163580,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I noticed a late fee on my account, this\nis not usual for me, would you please"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168180,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "remove it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169580,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the large banks will waive that\nfee, especially the first time, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174060,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially for a customer who has been\nwith them for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177260,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do not advertise this. There is no\nbutton for it on the website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181620,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the person on the phone very often has\nthe authority to take it straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185220,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off, and they will do it if you ask\nkindly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188440,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One phone call, thirty five dollars back,\nand it takes less time than reading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193020,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the statement did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194660,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And do not talk yourself out of making\nthat call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197440,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So many older people feel it is somehow\nrude to ask, or that a big bank would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201680,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never bend for one person. It is not rude,\nand they bend all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206640,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of a man who had carried the same\ncard for over twenty years, never missed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210660,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a payment in his life, and then landed in\nthe hospital for a week and came"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home to a late fee sitting on his\nstatement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216980,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He nearly paid it out of embarrassment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219520,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead he called, explained what had\nhappened in two sentences, and the woman"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223900,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the phone removed it before he had\nfinished speaking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227100,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twenty years of loyalty was the whole\nargument, and he did not even have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230940,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make it. He only had to ask. The second\nthing is to make sure it never happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235540,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "again, and this is the part that protects\npeople whose memory is not what it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239400,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once was, or who simply have too many due\ndates to track."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242540,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Set up an automatic payment for the\nminimum amount only."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246260,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not the full balance, unless you want\nthat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248820,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just the minimum. That way, even in a\nmonth when you are unwell, or traveling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253340,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or something slips, the payment goes out\non its own and the late fee never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257360,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lands. You can always pay more by hand on\ntop of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260980,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one setting, and it takes about five\nminutes on the telephone with your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264320,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank, closes that door for good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267600,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let me give you the second change, and\nthis one is newer, and plenty of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271840,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people have walked straight into it\nwithout ever realizing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274780,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know those payment plans that appear\nnow when you buy something online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278780,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pay in four easy payments. Nothing due\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281780,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They show up at the checkout on almost\nevery website, and on things as ordinary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286160,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a pair of shoes or a refrigerator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288980,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are called buy now, pay later, and\nfor the last few years they lived in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293440,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a strange gap where they were not really\nreported anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296920,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take one, pay it late, and your credit\nreport never knew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300690,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That has now changed. The major"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303040,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "credit bureaus have begun accepting this\ninformation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305760,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at least one of them is already\nallowing it to affect your credit score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310260,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So those little four payment plans, the\nones that never felt like real debt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314560,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are becoming part of your permanent credit\nrecord."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317460,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is why this matters more than it\nlooks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320160,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A recent study found that nearly half of\nthe people using these plans had paid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324320,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "late at least once in the past year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326740,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nearly half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328340,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not because they are careless, but because\nthe payments are small, they come"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332340,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out on odd dates, and it is honestly hard\nto keep track when you have three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336040,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or four of them running at the same time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338500,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When these were invisible, a late one cost\nyou a small fee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341940,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it can follow you onto your credit\nreport, and that is a different thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345600,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "altogether. And there is a second thing\nabout them worth knowing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348820,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because they are not treated like an\nordinary credit card, the protections"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352320,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are used to may not all be there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354360,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the item arrives broken, or never\narrives at all, sorting that out can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359080,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far messier than a simple charge dispute\non a normal card."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for anything expensive, or anything\nfrom a seller you do not know well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366420,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the plain old credit card is still the\nsafer way to pay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369740,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you use these, or if a son or\ndaughter or grandchild set one up on your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375160,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "account to help you buy something, do two\nthings this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379060,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Write down every one of those plans you\ncurrently have running, along with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384020,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the day each payment comes out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385780,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if the option is there, link them to\nautomatic payment so they cannot be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390780,
    "dDurationMs": 280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "missed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391900,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is it. I am not going to tell you\nnever to use them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395620,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For some purchases they are honestly\nuseful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398380,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just do not let them be invisible anymore,\nbecause the credit bureaus have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402420,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stopped treating them that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403980,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now the third one, which is the one I\ntruly want you to carry with you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408860,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because this one is on your side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411740,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a federal law that makes it\nillegal for any bank or lender to turn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416540,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you down for credit because of your age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419120,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not at sixty five. Not at seventy five."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422060,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not at ninety five. Your age, all by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425120,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "itself, cannot be the reason you are\ndenied"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427620,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a credit card, a loan, or a line of\ncredit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430600,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the law, and it has been the law\nfor a long time, and hardly any older"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435320,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person knows it well enough to use it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437780,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now why does this matter more today than\nit used to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441520,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because a lot of older people are being\nturned down, and they assume it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445540,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply what happens when you get older."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447840,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They stop applying. They accept worse\nterms on the cards they already carry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452500,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or they let a family member add them onto\nan account instead of holding one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457600,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in their own name, which weakens their own\ncredit standing over the years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462080,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that assumption is backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465540,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is a fact that ought to make you sit\nup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468300,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People over sixty five have the highest\naverage credit score of any age group"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472440,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this country. The highest. Not the\nlowest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476320,
    "dDurationMs": 5287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Older Americans are, as a group, the most\nreliable borrowers in America, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481647,
    "dDurationMs": 5153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the numbers say so. So if you ever\napply for a card or a loan and you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486800,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "turned down, do not simply accept it and\nfeel small about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491040,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lender is legally required to tell you\nthe specific reason for that denial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495860,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in writing, if you ask. Ask for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498880,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the reason given has anything to do\nwith your age, or with being retired,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503600,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or with the fact that your income comes\nfrom Social Security or a pension rather"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508440,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than a paycheck, that is worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510420,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "challenging, because income from Social\nSecurity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513280,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a pension is perfectly legitimate\nincome under that law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517780,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can file a complaint with the consumer\nprotection agency, at no cost, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523240,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would be surprised how quickly a bank\nrevisits a decision once a complaint"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is on file. And there is one more piece of\nthis that catches people out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532820,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your spouse handled all the credit for\nthe whole of your marriage, and every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536800,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "card was in their name, then your own\ncredit history can be far thinner than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541500,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would expect, even at eighty years\nold, and even with a lifetime of paying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every bill on time. That is not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "age discrimination, it is simply how the\nrecord"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552000,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "works. So if that describes you, the fix\nis to hold at least one card in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556860,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own name, use it lightly for something\nordinary like the groceries, and pay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561640,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it off each month. That builds a record\nthat belongs to you alone, and it matters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567640,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a great deal if you are ever left on your\nown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571260,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me put the three of them back\ntogether, because each one asks something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575860,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577520,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The late fee cap was struck down, so those\nfees are still full price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582300,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If one lands, call and ask them to take it\noff, and put your minimum payment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587080,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on automatic so it never happens again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590780,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those pay in four plans are now going onto\nyour credit report, so write down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ones you have and get them on\nautomatic too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597720,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And your age cannot legally be used\nagainst you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602280,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you get turned down, ask for the reason\nin writing, and challenge it if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606700,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "age or retirement income is anywhere in\nthat answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610460,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two of these three are the kind of thing\nnobody sends you a letter about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614820,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rule that would have helped you was\nreversed in a courtroom, and the payment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619000,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plans changed how they report you without\nany announcement at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623340,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is simply how it works now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625640,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The changes that cost you money arrive in\nsilence, and the protections that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630180,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "help you go unmentioned. But now you know\nall three, which puts you ahead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636220,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of almost everyone your age. So take the\nsmall step first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641000,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go and set up that automatic minimum\npayment this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644620,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is five minutes on the phone, and it\ncloses the door on the most expensive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649520,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the three for good. And here is my\nchallenge to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653860,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make that call about the late fee, and\nthen tell one person what happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659020,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a warning, not a lecture. Just tell\nthem what you got back with one phone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663480,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664760,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is how this kind of thing actually\nspreads, one person at a time, at a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669580,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kitchen counter or over a cup of coffee,\nlong after the banks have stopped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674040,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hoping anyone would find out."
    } ]
  } ]
}
